# Aegis extension configuration (Stage 3B).
#
# Copy to extension/.env and edit. `.env` is gitignored and must never be committed. WXT (via
# Vite's `envPrefix`) exposes any `WXT_`-prefixed variable here to the build as
# `import.meta.env.WXT_*` — see extension/net/network.ts, the only file that reads this.

# The server's base URL. Defaults to http://localhost:8000 (the Stage 0 `pnpm run server`
# command's port) when unset — most development does not need this file at all.
# WXT_SERVER_URL=http://localhost:8000
